{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"先写离开后的空落与舍不得，再让从前的亲近逐渐带出孤单、怀疑和回头的念头；中段集中呈现想念与受过的气之间的拉扯，后段转向不再逼自己选边，愿意带着想念继续生活。前后呼应「亲近」「一个人扛」「往前」：亲近从回忆里的温暖变成对未来的期待，一个人扛从孤单变成仍然可以迈步，往前则从最初的犹疑逐渐变成主动选择。feel按珠子顺序分组，同珠碎片相邻，保留温暖与不安并存的细节。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他离开熟悉的生活，起初觉得终于不用再委屈自己。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"离开熟悉的生活\", \"不用再委屈自己\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"沉甸甸\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像要宣告\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重量没接住\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"烟雾往上散\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音变轻\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越飘越远\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悬在半空\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"},\n            {\"text\": \"等着回声\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"1–6\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"硬撑着站直\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不能倒下\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里又游移\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还想保住体面\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知道往哪走\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"其实想停下\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可心里很快空了，想往前过却不知靠什么安定。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"心里很快空了\", \"不知靠什么安定\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-2\", \"S01-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"一声叹息\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"话刚出口就断\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"余音慢慢散\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"冷冷的空气\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里有事\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"说不清是生气\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"也像遗憾\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还是怀念\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知道为谁难过\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"刚从昏沉中醒来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"四周冷清\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"空荡荡\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"胸口发紧\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"眼前模糊\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"手还在发抖\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"伸手摸一摸\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"只摸到空\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没哭出来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知身在何处\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"恍恍惚惚\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"旧场景闪回来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的声音\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"当时的光线\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的感觉\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"过去回不来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体先记起来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"},\n            {\"text\": \"隐约认得步子\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"},\n            {\"text\": \"往前的牵引\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"想到再不能自在地过日子，他心里就慌。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不能自在地过日子\", \"心里就慌\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"步子终于清楚\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不像凯旋\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"远处传来的旧歌\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"只能哼几句\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"面向众人的庄严\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"私下的低声哼唱\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"珍惜的东西还在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不能照旧拥有\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"不像士兵步伐\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"腿脚发虚\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"在记忆里挪步\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"节奏很庄严\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"带着一点傲气\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"旋律很脆弱\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"凄婉得很\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"细碎的不安\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"半音暗暗蠕动\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"猛地往上冲\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"38–43\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又退了回来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"38–43\"},\n            {\"text\": \"再次攒起劲\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越聚越焦灼\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"52–63\"},\n            {\"text\": \"始终没落稳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"三连音不停\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"56–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸越来越急\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"56–65\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他提醒自己受过的气，却仍不甘心连好日子也丢掉。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"受过的气\", \"不甘心\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-2\", \"S02-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"把衣服整理好\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"抬起头来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不让人看出动摇\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"我没事\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"第一次还真信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"第二次努力信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"说到第三遍\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越说越在意\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悲伤还在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不肯交给悲伤\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"不甘心就这样消亡\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不是轻松自信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还不肯认输\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"硬撑着不服气\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他还憋着气，却又想起从前有人把他当自己人。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"憋着气\", \"当自己人\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"亲密\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"重锤砸下来\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一股火气\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不肯服气\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽强忽弱\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里一悬\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"步子不再端正\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"灵活流动\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动又不安\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想往前走\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知道往哪走\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66–91\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"前半段很焦躁\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"66–79\"},\n            {\"text\": \"急着往前\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"66–79\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽然柔和\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亲近又熟悉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像夏日麦浪\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"微风轻轻吹\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不用时时防备\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻松自在\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温柔得心颤\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越怀念越刺痛\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"离眼前好远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"那点高兴刚冒头，他又怕离开后未必更好过。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"高兴刚冒头\", \"未必更好过\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"耳边低声絮语\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"好几种声音\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"缠在一块\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"找不到出口\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下像流沙\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"抓不住重心\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"四处漂移\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"暂时侧身离开\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不正面碰问题\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"聊点别的\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"出去走走\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"注意力离开伤口\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"那一刻真轻松\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"问题还没答案\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"不是重新有劲\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"那股昂扬退下去\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"变得